#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.nandiff.rst:2
msgid "nandiff"
msgstr ""

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nandiff.nandiff:1
msgid "Compute differences between valid values, skipping NaN values."
msgstr "NaN 値をスキップして、有効値同士の差分を計算します。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nandiff.nandiff:3
msgid ""
"This function subtracts the ``shift``-th previous valid (non-NaN) value "
"from each valid value along the specified dimension, leaving NaN values "
"in place.  Writing the indices of the valid elements along ``dim`` as "
":math:`v_0, v_1, \\dots`, the result is:"
msgstr "この関数は、指定された次元に沿って、各有効値（NaN でない値）からその ``shift`` 個前の有効値を減算し、NaN 値はそのままの位置に残します。``dim`` に沿った有効要素のインデックスを :math:`v_0, v_1, \\dots` と書くと、結果は次のようになります:"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nandiff.nandiff:8
msgid ""
"\\text{nandiff}(x)[v_k] = x[v_k] - x[v_{k - \\text{shift}}]\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\text{nandiff}(x)[v_k] = x[v_k] - x[v_{k - \\text{shift}}]\n"
"\n"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nandiff.nandiff:11
msgid ""
"and NaN elsewhere.  The first ``shift`` valid positions become NaN "
"because they have no ``shift``-th previous valid value.  A negative "
"``shift`` computes differences against the following valid values, and "
"``shift=0`` yields zeros at valid positions."
msgstr "それ以外の位置は NaN になります。最初の ``shift`` 個の有効位置は、``shift`` 個前の有効値が存在しないため NaN になります。負の ``shift`` は後続の有効値との差分を計算し、``shift=0`` の場合、有効位置では 0 になります。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nandiff.nandiff:16
msgid ""
"This is useful for computing differences (e.g., price changes) of time "
"series with missing values, where a plain difference such as ``x.diff()``"
" would produce a NaN pair around every gap.  It is equivalent to ``x - "
"QF.nanshift(x, shift, dim)`` and, on NaN-free floating-point input, to "
"``x - QF.shift(x, shift, dim)``.  In pandas terms, it matches "
"``s.dropna().diff(shift)`` realigned to the original index."
msgstr "これは、``x.diff()`` のような単純な差分では欠損の前後で NaN のペアが生じてしまうため、欠損値を含む時系列の差分（例: 価格変化）を計算する際に有用です。この関数は ``x - QF.nanshift(x, shift, dim)`` と等価であり、NaN を含まない浮動小数点入力に対しては ``x - QF.shift(x, shift, dim)`` とも等価です。pandas で言えば、``s.dropna().diff(shift)`` を元のインデックスに揃え直したものに一致します。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.nandiff.rst
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "パラメータ"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nandiff.nandiff:25
msgid ""
"The input tensor.  NaN values are skipped and remain NaN in the result.  "
"Integer tensors have no NaN values to skip, so this behaves like ``x - "
"QF.shift(x, shift, dim)`` except that vacated positions are filled with "
"``0`` by :func:`nanshift`, i.e., the first ``shift`` elements are "
"returned as is."
msgstr "入力テンソル。NaN 値はスキップされ、結果でも NaN のまま残ります。整数テンソルにはスキップすべき NaN 値が存在しないため、``x - QF.shift(x, shift, dim)`` と同様に動作しますが、空いた位置が :func:`nanshift` によって ``0`` で埋められる点が異なります。すなわち、最初の ``shift`` 個の要素はそのまま返されます。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nandiff.nandiff:32
msgid ""
"Number of valid positions to look back. Positive values compute "
"differences against previous valid values, negative values against "
"following valid values. Default is 1."
msgstr "遡る有効位置の数。正の値は前の有効値との差分を、負の値は後続の有効値との差分を計算します。デフォルト値は 1 です。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nandiff.nandiff:37
msgid ""
"The dimension along which to compute differences. Default is -1 (the last"
" dimension)."
msgstr "差分を計算する次元。デフォルトは -1 で、最後の次元を意味します。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.nandiff.rst
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "戻り値"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nandiff.nandiff:41
msgid ""
"A tensor of the same shape as the input, containing the differences "
"between valid values.  NaN input positions and valid positions without a "
"``shift``-th previous (or following) valid value are NaN."
msgstr "入力と同じ形状のテンソルで、有効値同士の差分を格納します。入力が NaN の位置と、``shift`` 個前（または後）の有効値が存在しない有効位置は NaN になります。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.nandiff.rst
msgid "Return type"
msgstr "戻り値の型"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.nandiff.rst
msgid "Raises"
msgstr "例外"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nandiff.nandiff:47
msgid ""
"If ``x`` is a boolean tensor, because PyTorch does     not support "
"subtraction of boolean tensors."
msgstr "``x`` がブールテンソルの場合。PyTorch がブールテンソルの減算をサポートしていないためです。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nandiff.nandiff:50
msgid "Example"
msgstr "使用例"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nandiff.nandiff:52
msgid ""
">>> x = torch.tensor([1.0, nan, 3.0, 4.0, nan, 6.0])\n"
">>> QF.nandiff(x)\n"
"tensor([nan, nan, 2., 1., nan, 2.])"
msgstr ""
">>> x = torch.tensor([1.0, nan, 3.0, 4.0, nan, 6.0])\n"
">>> QF.nandiff(x)\n"
"tensor([nan, nan, 2., 1., nan, 2.])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nandiff.nandiff:56
msgid ""
">>> # Negative shift: difference against the next valid value.\n"
">>> QF.nandiff(x, shift=-1)\n"
"tensor([-2., nan, -1., -2., nan, nan])"
msgstr ""
">>> # 負のシフト: 次の有効値との差分。\n"
">>> QF.nandiff(x, shift=-1)\n"
"tensor([-2., nan, -1., -2., nan, nan])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nandiff.nandiff:60
msgid ""
">>> # 2D example with dim=0\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([[1.0, nan, 3.0],\n"
"...                   [nan, 5.0, 6.0]])\n"
">>> QF.nandiff(x, shift=1, dim=0)\n"
"tensor([[nan, nan, nan],\n"
"        [nan, nan, 3.]])"
msgstr ""
">>> # dim=0 を指定した 2 次元の例\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([[1.0, nan, 3.0],\n"
"...                   [nan, 5.0, 6.0]])\n"
">>> QF.nandiff(x, shift=1, dim=0)\n"
"tensor([[nan, nan, nan],\n"
"        [nan, nan, 3.]])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nandiff.nandiff:67
msgid ""
"Infinite values are treated as valid values and follow IEEE 754 "
"arithmetic: the difference between an infinite and a finite value is "
"±inf, and the difference between two infinities of the same sign is NaN."
msgstr "無限大の値は有効な値として扱われ、IEEE 754 の算術に従います。無限大と有限値の差は ±inf になり、同符号の無限大同士の差は NaN になります。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nandiff.nandiff:73
msgid ":func:`nanshift`: Shift function that skips NaN values."
msgstr ":func:`nanshift`: NaN 値をスキップするシフト関数。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nandiff.nandiff:74
msgid ":func:`shift`: Standard shift function without NaN handling."
msgstr ":func:`shift`: NaN 処理を行わない標準的なシフト関数。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nandiff.nandiff:75
msgid ":func:`ffill`: Forward fill missing values."
msgstr ":func:`ffill`: 欠損値を前方補完する関数。"

